Employee Master Data Sync & Role Synchronization Requirement
Background

The application currently uses All_GeoEmpDataDEX_WV as the primary employee master table. This table serves as the source for:

vw_MasterEmployee
Employee Dashboard
Manager Dashboard
RM Dashboard
Compliance Reports
Hierarchy-based reports
Employee Role Synchronization (sp_SyncEmployeeRoles)

Employee data is received daily from an external source via AWS S3 in the form of two CSV files:

Active Employees File

Contains the complete current active workforce.

Inactive Employees File

Contains the complete current inactive/separated workforce.

Both files have the same structure as All_GeoEmpDataDEX_WV.

Objective

Build an automated daily synchronization process that:

Reads employee data files from S3.
Validates the received data.
Synchronizes employee records into All_GeoEmpDataDEX_WV.
Automatically manages employee and manager roles.
Maintains a complete audit trail of synchronization activities.
Prevents bad or incomplete files from impacting dashboards and reporting.
